{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1061679/block/singleImage/3256070/df/1551290910_Vh.jpg?updatedAt=1793671343\"/><figcaption>運輸署咪錶泊車系統故障</figcaption></figure><p>運輸署今早約8時20分，接獲營運商報告咪錶泊車系統故障，現正緊急搶修。 營運商會從速完成修復工作 署方已責成營運商從速跟進及完成所需修復工作，將對駕駛人士的影響減至最低，並徹查事故原因及提交報告。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:04.295031+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:02:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T03:58:45.789367+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:41.766374+00:00","content_hash":"b420b9828e38d414f7cc3be7f7681533271855bd53dba3c919dd0f8de8261161","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:04.295031+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}